{
  "_comment": "Capability taxonomy with THREE evidence channels. 'strong' keywords may match anywhere in a skill's description. 'weak' keywords only count when they appear in the skill NAME. 'files' keywords match the reference files a skill ships - the strongest signal of all, because a skill that ships reference/critique.md critiques. Rationale: a landing-page design skill that mentions 'product page' is not a provider of ecommerce capability, but a skill named 'shopify-cart' is, and a skill shipping reference/cart.md is. Edit here to sharpen routing, then rerun scripts/build-registry.py.",
  "_exclude": [
    "aswath-capability"
  ],
  "_exclude_reason": "Router skills describe TRIGGER PHRASES ('build me an ecommerce site'), not capabilities they provide. Letting them self-tag makes the orchestrator compete with the skills it dispatches.",
